{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Brightdesk** — strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n2. **Orbitly** — teams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker.\n3. **Calmline** — the most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n\n**Bottom line:** Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Orbitly is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fc-74b3-a821-af923dc58cea","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:11.950Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["support software reporting csat","help desk reporting comparison"],"latency_ms":7950,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[143,153],[414,424]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[231,238],[462,469]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[307,315]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dd0-7